        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a manufacturer and marketer of medical devices and Human Tissue and Cell Based Products (“HCT/Ps”) and therefore are subject to extensive regulation by the FDA, the Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services (“CMS”) of the U.S.",
